  "name": "Porchetta-Style Pork Roast",
  "subtitle": "Herb- and fennel-seasoned pork with a bright parsley sauce",
  "description": "Roll a butterflied pork shoulder around a savory herb filling, chill it to set, then roast until tender with a crisp exterior. Serve with a vinegar-bright parsley sauce.",
